WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:10.120
You who listen and watch, learn that killing
a Sloughi is as serious as killing 7 men.

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:16.060
It has been said by the poet
that the Sloughi is not a dog.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:22.900
Among all creatures, the sloughi, by its grace and nobility, gladdens the soul of its master and fills him with pride.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.640
For 5000 years, it has inspired the stories of men.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:31.390
Here is a story among stories for you.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:53.960
Hassen is a hunter. And his sloughi is his
only weapon. Hassen doesn't own a sloughi.

00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:57.350
But both are possessed by hunting fever.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.950
Six years ago, Hassen was a simple
shepherd with a few sheep.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:18.090
Then one day, an old hunter gave him his
sloughi, but he never wanted to say where it came from.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:41.240
Hassen named her Janah.
Janah means bird's wing.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.970
Because of all the sloughis, Janah is the fastest.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:51.820
But one morning fate caught up with Janah,
leading him to a place he should never have gone.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.630
On the land of the caïd. Lord and master of the place.

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:09.350
Beside the princess of the Sloughis, her servant Yasmina.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.130
At the foot of the caïd's sloughia tree, a light of beauty.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.140
But you don't disturb the boss's Sloughia.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.680
And we don't speak to the maid Yasmina.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:59.550
If this meeting had not taken place, Janah's story would have been very different.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:05.170
As for Hassen the hunter, he was far from guessing what was going to happen.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:18.320
The Sloughia lives in the Caïd's palace.
He named her Ziya.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.120
Ziya means light.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:26.330
She is the velvet of his soul.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.720
Everyone knows that the kingpin indulges his every whim.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:34.970
For the past year, Ziya, the pearl of his eyes,
has been old enough to bear children.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:40.310
For a year now, the crime boss has been looking for a suitor worthy of his princess.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.210
He wants the most beautiful sloughi in the whole province for her.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:50.990
He entrusted the moqadem, his hunting leader,
with this important mission.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.440
Every day, the moqadem presents him with males.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.710
But none of them are worthy of Ziya.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:12.440
If this continues, there could soon be
another Moqadem in place of the Moqadem.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:18.360
To please his boss and regain his favor,
the Moqadem came up with an idea.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:27.120
From the moqadem's mouth, everyone must learn that
the caïd is looking for a male worthy of his sloughia.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.620
All suitors must present themselves at the palace.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:42.180
A major hunt will take place to select the best one.

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:51.690
As a reward, a horse. A horse from the Palace stables.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.790
But above all, let's not see any bastards there.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:08.960
That day, Hassen understood that Janah's destiny was about to be fulfilled.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:15.540
Of all the Sloughis, Janah possesses the finest qualities.

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:25.500
Its jaw is powerful, its shoulders are muscular, its chest is deep, its ears are set perfectly high.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.610
Hassen always knew that his sloughi
was of the highest nobility.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:46.760
May it be Janah who chooses you to become a prince.

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:50.270
As soon as the boss sees you, he'll know.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:15.870
They came from all the valleys.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:20.860
For the horse, of course, but above all
for the promise of a princely wedding.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.980
Everyone knows their sloughi is the best.

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.950
But of all of them, only one will be elected.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:47.670
The moqadem's eye sees everything. And his finger points to
those who are authorized to appear before the caïd.

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:12.100
Janah's story could have ended here. Her worth recognized, definitively.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:20.310
But unfortunately for her, Yasmina, the Sloughia's servant, was also the Moqadem's daughter.

00:09:28.190 --> 00:09:31.220
The Moqadem is a more jealous father than all fathers.

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:34.810
No one has the right to speak to his daughter.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:40.990
And certainly not a poor shepherd like Hassen.
So the moqadem attacked Janah.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:43.720
And he found all the faults in the world.

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:01.540
Thus, Janah could not show herself to the eyes of the caïd and his betrothed.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:07.220
And Hassen's pride was wounded to the point of outrage.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:08.770
Cursed be the moqadem.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:11:02.620
As for Janah's love affair, the sloughi with the sloughia,
Hassen was sure they would never see each other again.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.150
But the twists of fate are infinitely mysterious.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:38.160
It was written that the servant Yasmina held
in her hands the destiny of Janah's love.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:55.630
The Moqadem watches over the lands of the caïd
like a father watches over his daughter.

00:11:56.890 --> 00:12:00.340
And that day, he called Hassen every name under the sun.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:26.200
Nothing can stop a dispute between two hunters. Nothing.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:32.240
Except to learn that a large hare has been seen in the area.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.510
The young shepherd boy spoke of a hare the size of a gazelle.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:51.190
This is the opportunity chosen by the master to
test the abilities of the contenders.

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:38.310
The hare sleeps during the day.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.360
It's so low-lying that you could step on it without realizing it.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.140
Smells, finding smells.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:47.130
One lead.

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:49.470
Follow your instincts.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:50.970
And Janah's nose.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:30.380
Hassen never hunts in driven hunts. He is
like the hare. He doesn't like noise.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:34.730
The hare is cunning. It moves by hopping.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:40.700
And whoever follows its scent suddenly loses it.
So, you have to guess its route.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:30.040
If only the kingpin had been able to see Janah.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.470
If only the sloughia could tell the caïd.

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:25.920
On that day, Janah defied her destiny.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:30.890
And the chieftain, who had never seen her before, noticed
the beauty of this sloughi that had been hidden from him.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:41.990
Through Yasmina, he learned Janah's name.

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:01.400
He could learn nothing from Hassen's mouth.

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:05.570
So he wanted to see with his own eyes.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:53.560
There are few sloughis that know how to capture a hare without killing it.

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:23.170
It's a female, and enormous because she
will soon have babies.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.960
O you who escaped the pack of the caïd,

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:47.830
Let it be written that you will live long and that your children, when they are born, will learn of your cunning.

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:03.770
The caïd had seen Janah, but he did not know
the offense committed by his moqadem.

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:44.800
Everyone dreams of owning a thoroughbred horse. But a horse,
however beautiful, will not redeem Janah's honor.

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:23.400
The offense committed against Janah will separate him from Ziya forever.

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:27.660
Learn, Hassen, that you are not worth our attention.

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:35.770
A man's honor is worthless if he cannot see the sorrow of his faithful Sloughi.

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:38.880
There is no offense that cannot be forgiven.

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:27.940
Thus ended the story of Janah and the sloughia.

00:24:00.090 --> 00:24:04.800
Instead of the horse, Hassen asked the chief to
take the young Sloughi of his choice,

00:24:05.220 --> 00:24:09.660
And the chief granted his request. For the chief is great and just.

00:24:52.240 --> 00:24:57.690
O you who listen, you will remember that this one
is not a stranger among strangers.

00:24:58.500 --> 00:25:00.480
His name is Janah's son.

00:25:01.260 --> 00:25:03.180
He will be a prince among princes.

00:25:04.830 --> 00:25:06.000
So be it.

